#: app/templates/legal/security.html:8
msgid "Security policy"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:10
msgid ""
"We take security seriously. If you find a vulnerability, please report it"
" privately to the address listed in our"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:12
msgid "Encryption model"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:13
msgid ""
"Messages are encrypted in your browser with AES-256-GCM. The 256-bit key "
"is generated client-side and lives only in the URL fragment, which "
"browsers never transmit to servers. The operator therefore has no ability"
" to read message content, even with full database access."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:14
msgid ""
"Attachments are encrypted with the same key as the message body, using a "
"fresh AES-GCM nonce per file. The server only ever sees opaque ciphertext"
" blobs — the original filename, MIME-type and contents are part of the "
"encrypted payload and are invisible to the operator."
msgstr ""
"Gli allegati vengono crittografati con la stessa chiave del messaggio, "
"usando un nonce AES-GCM fresco per ogni file. Il server vede solo blob di"
" ciphertext opachi — nome del file, tipo MIME e contenuto originali fanno"
" parte del payload crittografato e sono invisibili all'operatore."

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:16
msgid "Account security"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:18
msgid "Passwords hashed with argon2id"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:19
msgid "Optional TOTP-based two-factor authentication with backup codes"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:20
msgid "Mandatory 2FA for administrative accounts (enforced on first login)"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:21
msgid "Recipient e-mail addresses are stored only as keyed HMAC-SHA256 hashes"
msgstr ""
"Gli indirizzi e-mail dei destinatari vengono memorizzati solo come hash "
"HMAC-SHA256 con chiave"

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:22
msgid ""
"Server-side metadata (TOTP secrets, backup codes) is encrypted at rest "
"with a dedicated key"
msgstr ""
"I metadati lato server (secret TOTP, codici di backup) vengono "
"crittografati a riposo con una chiave dedicata"

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:25
msgid "Transport and browser hardening"
msgstr "Hardening trasporto e browser"

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:27
msgid ""
"Strict Content-Security-Policy with per-request nonces — third-party or "
"injected scripts cannot execute"
msgstr ""
"Content-Security-Policy rigorosa con nonce per richiesta — script di "
"terze parti o iniettati non possono essere eseguiti"

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:28
msgid "CSRF protection on every state-changing request"
msgstr "Protezione CSRF su ogni richiesta che modifica lo stato"

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:29
msgid "HTTP-only / SameSite session cookies"
msgstr "Cookie di sessione HTTP-only / SameSite"

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:30
msgid ""
"All CSS, JavaScript and fonts are vendored and served from this server — "
"no CDN, no third-party requests at runtime"
msgstr ""
"Tutti i file CSS, JavaScript e i font sono vendored e serviti da questo "
"server — niente CDN, nessuna richiesta a terze parti a runtime"

#: app/templates/legal/security.html:31
msgid "HSTS is set when the application is configured for HTTPS"
msgstr "HSTS viene impostato quando l'applicazione è configurata per HTTPS"

